{"id":"0192531d-c829-7b41-9433-b096da3722c4","name":"ACO","domain":"aco.com","website":"https://aco.com","type":"private","legalName":null,"industry":"Manufacturing","industries":["Manufacturing/Plastic, Packaging & Containers","Manufacturing/Tires & Rubber","Construction/Civil Engineering Construction","Retail"],"categories":["b2b"],"employees":"201-500","reported_employees":"5K-10K","revenue":"over-1b","description":"ACO is a global WaterTech company specializing in rainwater and wastewater management. The group offers systems and solutions under the ACO WaterCycle for professional drainage, cleaning, and controlled discharge or reuse of water, with a focus on sustainable water infrastructure and urban water management. Headquartered in Germany, ACO operates in over 50 countries and emphasizes innovation, sustainability, and transparent processes to improve water quality and cycle continuity. The company highlights applications in drainage, landscaping, hospitality, data centers, and other sectors through its worldwide references and regional subsidiaries.","keywords":["rainwater management","wastewater management","stormwater drainage","drainage systems","water cycle","sustainable water infrastructure","blue-green infrastructure","green city","urban water management","water reuse","water treatment","premier watertech","industrial drainage","gastronomy drainage","airport drainage","landscape drainage","gutter and trench drainage","oil and sediment separators","regional subsidiaries","water management","sustainable development","water recycling","pollution prevention","smart technology","groundwater preservation"],"technologies":["Outlook","Microsoft Office 365","Zendesk","Microsoft Azure Hosting","Google Maps","Google Font API","Hotjar","Salesforce","Cedexis Radar","Apple-Business-Manager","Caddy","Go","Google-Analytics","Google-Tag-Manager","Php","Section-Io","Typo3-Cms"],"subsidiaries":["acobd.co.uk","aco.bg","acocan.ca","aco.ch","aco.lv","aco.nl","aco.dk","aco-nordic.se","aco.at","aco.ro","aco.com.tr","aco.co.uk","acousa.com"],"founded_year":1946,"naics_codes":["326122","326199","237110","423720"],"location":{"country":{"code":"DE","name":"Germany","latitude":51,"longitude":9},"state":{"id":1390,"name":"Schleswig-Holstein","code":"SH","latitude":54.219368,"longitude":9.696116},"city":{"id":40879,"name":"Büdelsdorf","latitude":54.31844,"longitude":9.67295},"address":"Am Ahlmannkai 24, 24782 Büdelsdorf, Germany","postal_code":null,"phone":"+49 4331 354-0"},"financial":{"stock_symbol":null,"stock_exchange":"other","total_funding":null,"funding_stage":null,"funding_date":null,"funding":null},"socials":{"linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/aco-group","linkedin_id":"971002","twitter_url":"https://twitter.com/aco_gruppe","facebook_url":"https://www.facebook.com/aco/","instagram_url":"https://www.instagram.com/aco_group/","angellist_url":null,"crunchbase_url":null,"youtube_url":"https://www.youtube.com/@aco","github_url":null,"g2_url":null},"page_rank":2.5516744,"logo_url":"https://api.companyenrich.com/companies/logo/0192531d-c829-7b41-9433-b096da3722c4","seo_description":"ACO Group is a family-owned company based in Rendsburg/Büdelsdorf, Germany, specializing in drainage technology. Founded in 1946, ACO has grown to operate in over 46 countries with 41 production sites and employs around 5,400 people. The company generated sales of approximately €1.14 billion in 2023.

ACO offers a range of professional drainage solutions, including drainage channels, oil and grease separators, backflow stop systems, pumps, and pressure-water-tight cellar windows. Their products focus on effective water management, environmental protection, and addressing climate change challenges by facilitating efficient drainage and water reuse.

With a history that dates back to the Carlshütte foundry established in 1827, ACO has expanded internationally through innovation and strategic acquisitions. The company serves various sectors, including construction, infrastructure, and environmental services, providing sustainable solutions to meet diverse customer needs.","updated_at":"2026-08-11T14:11:56.766932Z"}

{"id":"01925132-1c6a-7622-893b-bdd802a6097d","name":"Alzchem","domain":"alzchem.com","website":"https://alzchem.com","type":"public","legalName":null,"industry":"Manufacturing","industries":["Manufacturing/Chemicals & Related Products"],"categories":["b2b"],"employees":"51-200","reported_employees":"1K-5K","revenue":"200m-1b","description":"Alzchem is a globally active specialty chemicals company and a market leader in multiple niche fields. The company focuses on alpha chemistry and NCN chemistry in its production network, with a strong emphasis on creatine products, including Creapure®. It serves diverse applications across agriculture, animal and human nutrition, pharma, fine chemicals, metallurgy, renewable energy, and defense, operating from four production sites in Southeast Bavaria and Sundsvall, Sweden, with sales offices in the United States, China, and the United Kingdom.","keywords":["creatine production","creapure","guanidine salts","bioselect guanidine salts","nitralz","creavitalis","pharma applications","animal nutrition","human nutrition","agriculture","fine chemicals","metallurgy","defense","custom synthesis","renewable energy","specialty chemicals","nutrition","pharmaceuticals","sustainability","food production","chemicals"],"technologies":["Amazon SES","Microsoft Office 365","Google Cloud Hosting","CSC Corporate Domains","Google Tag Manager","Vimeo","Mobile Friendly","Outlook","Ruby On Rails","Apache","Apple-Business-Manager","Cloudflare-Cdn","Drupal","Google-Maps","Google-Tag-Manager","Php","Platform-Sh","Typo3-Cms"],"subsidiaries":null,"founded_year":1908,"naics_codes":["325199","325188"],"location":{"country":{"code":"DE","name":"Germany","latitude":51,"longitude":9},"state":{"id":1377,"name":"Bavaria","code":"BY","latitude":48.790447,"longitude":11.4978895},"city":null,"address":"CHEMIEPARK TROSTBERG, Dr.-Albert-Frank-Str. 32, 83308 Trostberg, Germany","postal_code":"83308","phone":"+49 8621 86-0"},"financial":{"stock_symbol":"ACT.DE","stock_exchange":"etra","total_funding":37600000,"funding_stage":null,"funding_date":null,"funding":[{"date":"2024-03-01T00:00:00Z","amount":"37622248","type":"other","url":null,"from":null}]},"socials":{"linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/alzchem","linkedin_id":"1591734","twitter_url":"https://twitter.com/AlzChem","facebook_url":"https://facebook.com/alzchem/","instagram_url":"https://instagram.com/alzchem.ausbildung","angellist_url":null,"crunchbase_url":null,"youtube_url":"https://youtube.com/user/alzchem","github_url":null,"g2_url":null},"page_rank":2.2112653,"logo_url":"https://api.companyenrich.com/companies/logo/01925132-1c6a-7622-893b-bdd802a6097d","seo_description":"Alzchem Group AG is a specialty chemicals company based in Trostberg, Germany, with a strong presence in niche markets worldwide. Founded in 1984, the company operates production sites in Germany and Sweden and employs around 1,700 people. Alzchem focuses on innovation, quality, and sustainability, supported by its extensive research and development capabilities.

The company’s core business centers on chemical products derived from the nitrogen-carbon-nitrogen (NCN) chain. Alzchem offers a diverse range of specialty chemicals for various sectors, including health and pharma, nutrition, renewable energies, agriculture, metallurgy, and defense. Notable products include Creapure, a high-purity creatine monohydrate, and Nitroguanidin, a stable energetic compound for defense applications. Alzchem also provides contract manufacturing services and supports chemical parks with infrastructure and operational services.

With a commitment to sustainability and environmental responsibility, Alzchem aims to address global challenges through its innovative product offerings. The company maintains sales offices in the USA, China, and the UK, ensuring a robust global customer base.","updated_at":"2026-08-12T21:00:59.967511Z"}

