{"id":"0192585b-6794-7ec6-95ca-8c4a5b04b71e","name":"Centrotec","domain":"centrotec.de","website":"https://centrotec.de","type":"public","legalName":null,"industry":"Finance","industries":["Holding Companies & Conglomerates","Real Estate","Finance/Investment Banking","Finance/Lending & Brokerage","Finance/Venture Capital & Private Equity"],"categories":["b2b","service-provider"],"employees":"11-50","reported_employees":"1K-5K","revenue":"200m-1b","description":"Centrotec SE is a European investment holding focused on managing and growing a diversified portfolio across industrial companies, real estate developments, and financial assets. The group emphasizes long-term value creation, sustainability, and disciplined governance, with a footprint across Germany, the Netherlands, and other EU countries. It positions itself as an owner with a family heritage and multi-generational time horizon, aiming to build great companies and deliver superior returns for investors. The company operates as a parent to industrial, real estate, and financial activities, seeking opportunities to contribute to sustainable and liveable urban environments.","keywords":["industrial portfolio","real estate developments","financial asset management","urban real estate","sustainable cities","long-term investment","family investment company","german roots","global reach","portfolio rebalancing","value-oriented investing","ownership mindset","leadership culture","eu investment firm","european markets","industrial real estate","active asset management","public and private sectors","real assets","energy efficiency","heating systems","ventilation technology","climate control","renewable energy","solar thermal","biogas","heat recovery"],"technologies":["Mimecast","Microsoft Azure Hosting","Microsoft Office 365","Sophos","Microsoft Azure","Apache","Ubuntu","Mobile Friendly","Vue-Js"],"subsidiaries":null,"founded_year":1998,"naics_codes":["551112","551114","531390","531312","523920"],"location":{"countr