The company operates through three main segments. The Climate Systems segment develops and sells a range of heating and ventilation solutions aimed at improving energy efficiency and indoor air quality. The Gas Flue Systems segment provides condensing boilers and air piping systems that enhance home ventilation and promote energy savings. Additionally, CENTROTEC SE has a Medical Technology & Engineering Plastics segment, which manufactures medical technology products and diagnostic instruments, showcasing its diversification into healthcare.

CENTROTEC SE serves a diverse clientele, including residential, commercial, and industrial customers, by offering innovative and sustainable technologies that enhance energy efficiency and environmental performance in building systems, along with a presence in the medical technology sector.","updated_at":"2026-08-11T09:55:07.393794Z"}

{"id":"01924eba-413f-73e4-9d98-daa015d371d8","name":"Contilia","domain":"contilia.de","website":"https://contilia.de","type":"public","legalName":null,"industry":"Hospitals & Physicians Clinics","industries":["Hospitals & Physicians Clinics/Medical & Surgical Hospitals","Healthcare Services/Medical Laboratories & Imaging Centers","Healthcare Services/Mental Health & Rehabilitation Facilities","Hospitals & Physicians Clinics/Medical Specialists"],"categories":["b2c","service-provider"],"employees":"51-200","reported_employees":"5K-10K","revenue":null,"description":"Contilia is a healthcare group based in the Essen region, operating a network of hospitals and medical facilities. The organization focuses on comprehensive medical care, emergency services, and community health programs across its sites, including general and specialized departments. It positions itself with a focus on timely and essential care for patients, with services spanning inpatient and outpatient settings and affiliated social initiatives. The brand emphasizes care for patients and community welfare in Germany.","keywords":["emergency medicine","geriatric medicine","pediatric care","notfallmedizin","notaufnahme","psychiatric emergencies","hospital network","medical departments","adult and child health","healthcare system","community health","ambulatory services","rehabilitation","surgery","anästhesie und schmerztherapie","pflege","berufsbildung","ausbildung","soziale initiativen","hospital","healthcare","medical services","teaching hospital","academic hospital"],"technologies":["Microsoft Office 365","Piwik","Bootstrap Framework","Google Maps","Mobile Friendly","Apache","Amazon-Ecs","Cloudflare-Cdn","Google-Analytics","Google-Tag-Manager","Matomo","Microsoft-Azure-Cdn","Nginx","Php","Typo3-Cms"],"subsidiaries":null,"founded_year":2006,"naics_codes":["622110","622310","622210","621498","621399"],"location":{"country":{"code":"DE","name":"Germany","latitude":51,"longitude":9},"state":{"id":1383,"na