The organization manages several hospitals and clinics, including Elisabeth Hospital Essen and St. Marien Hospital Mülheim an der Ruhr, offering acute care and specialized treatments. It also provides medical care centers with services in laboratory medicine and outpatient diagnostics. Additionally, Contilia focuses on prevention and rehabilitation through health promotion programs and offers senior care services, including nursing and assisted living facilities tailored to the needs of the elderly.

With an estimated workforce of 5,000 to 9,999 employees, Contilia emphasizes quality of life and self-determined care for individuals at all life stages. Its mission combines healthcare excellence with a dedication to dignity and community support.","updated_at":"2026-08-12T10:25:20.501078Z"}

{"id":"01924f3e-bdf3-7172-8928-da120c147f0e","name":"Datagroup","domain":"datagroup.de","website":"https://datagroup.de","type":"public","legalName":null,"industry":"Business Services","industries":["Business Services/Facilities Management & Commercial Cleaning","Media & Internet/Data Collection & Internet Portals","Business Services/Custom Software & IT Services"],"categories":["b2b","service-provider"],"employees":"501-1K","reported_employees":"1K-5K","revenue":"200m-1b","description":"Datagroup is a German IT service provider offering a broad portfolio that covers IT outsourcing, IT operations, and digitalization initiatives. Through its CORBOX platform, it provides modular IT outsourcing services including cloud, SAP, security, and workplace solutions, backed by German data centers and ISO-based processes. The company emphasizes secure, reliable IT management for mid-sized and large organizations and operates across multiple locations in Germany with regional and international project delivery. It positions itself as a full-spectrum partner for IT outsourcing, IT consulting, and digital transformation.","keywords":["corbox","it outsourcing","sap services","application management","data center","iso 27001","iso 20000","security services","workplace services","network services","it security","digitalization","it consulting","automation","process and industry solutions","sap consulting","sap solutions","careers in it","customer it outsourcing","it services","it solutions","it transformation","modular services","technology innovation"],"technologies":["Google Analytics","Google Font API","Microsoft Office 365","Outlook","reCAPTCHA","WordPress.org","Apache","Nginx","Mysql","Php","Wordpress","Yoast-Seo"],"subsidiaries":null,"founded_year":1983,"naics_codes":["541513","518210","541512","541511","541519"],"location":{"country":{"code":"DE","name":"Germany","latitude":51,"longitude":9},"state":{"id":1376,"name":"Baden-Württemberg","code":"BW","latitude":48.661602,"longit