The company offers a diverse range of services, including modular IT outsourcing solutions branded as CORBOX, which allows clients to customize their service packages. DATAGROUP also provides managed and private cloud services, business application development, and comprehensive network management. With a commitment to security and quality, DATAGROUP operates ISO 27001-certified data centers and follows ISO 20000-certified IT management processes. 

With over 2,000 employees, DATAGROUP serves a broad customer base across various sectors, ensuring tailored IT services that meet the specific needs of the German Mittelstand. The company is dedicated to enhancing operational efficiency and transparency through its advanced IT solutions.","updated_at":"2026-08-09T01:11:12.108045Z"}

{"id":"01925033-2d9b-78de-85f4-0c69b8820a36","name":"Eissmann Group Automotive","domain":"eissmann.com","website":"https://eissmann.com","type":"private","legalName":null,"industry":"Manufacturing","industries":["Manufacturing/Motor Vehicles","Manufacturing/Automotive Parts"],"categories":["b2b"],"employees":"201-500","reported_employees":"1K-5K","revenue":"10m-50m","description":"Eissmann Group Automotive designs and manufactures innovative interior solutions for the automotive industry, evolving from a component supplier to a system integrator. The company focuses on creating immersive vehicle interiors by integrating electronic components, control modules, and advanced haptic and lighting technologies. With a global presence and a multidisciplinary approach, it collaborates across engineering disciplines to transform complex interior challenges into compelling, user-focused experiences.","keywords":["automotive interior","system integration in automotive","interior electronics","haptics","kinematics","lighting design","control modules","vehicle interior","leather interior","interior ambience","mechatronik","electronics integration","dashboard interfaces","soft touch surfaces","sensor integration","human-machine interface","ergonomics in automotive","vehicle cabin design","fabric and trim design","plastics and materials","automotive","interior components","shifter modules","trim components","innovation","manufacturing"],"technologies":["Outlook","Microsoft Office 365","Google translate widget","Mobile Friendly","Apache","Google translate API","Apple-Business-Manager","Google-Pagespeed","Php","Typo3-Cms"],"subsidiaries":null,"founded_year":1964,"naics_codes":["336360","336399"],"location":{"country":{"code":"DE","name":"Germany","latitude":51,"longitude":9},"state":{"id":1376,"name":"Baden-Württemberg","code":"BW","latitude":48.661602,"longitude":9.350134},"city":{"id":34495,"name":"Bad Urach","latitude":48.49107,"longitude":9.40009},"address":"Münsinger Straße 150, 72574 Bad Urach, Germany","postal_code":"72574","phone":"+49 71 25 93 73-0"},"financial":{"stock_symbol":null,"stock_exchange":null,"total_funding":null,"funding_stage":null,"funding_date":null,"funding":null},"socials":{"linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eissmann-group-automotive","linkedin_id":"329474","twitter_url":null,"facebook_url":"https://www.facebook.com/eissmanngroupautomotive","instagram_url":"https://www.instagram.com/eissmann.group.automotive/","angellist_url":null,"crunchbase_url":null,"youtube_url":null,"github_url":null,"g2_url":null},"page_rank":1.0139842,"logo_url":"https://api.companyenrich.com/companies/logo/01925033-2d9b-78de-85f4-0c69b8820a36","seo_description":"Eissmann Group Automotive is a global automotive supplier based in Bad Urach, Germany, founded in 1964. The company specializes in the design, development, and manufacturing of vehicle interiors, including control modules, trim parts, and complete interior systems. Eissmann has evolved into a creative partner for the automotive industry, focusing on innovative and integrated interior solutions that encompass surface design, control haptics, kinematics, lighting, and electronics.

With approximately 4,787 employees and revenues around $1.4 billion, Eissmann operates production facilities in Europe, North America, Mexico, China, and the United States. Its North American subsidiary, Eissmann Automotive NA, has a significant manufacturing presence in Pell City, Alabama, employing over 800 workers. The company emphasizes quality and process management, adhering to IATF 16949 standards to ensure defect prevention and continuous improvement.

Eissmann serves top automotive manufacturers worldwide, providing high-quality, innovative interior solutions that meet the evolving demands of the industry. The company is committed to delivering functional and exciting car interiors for various vehicle types and drive systems.","updated_at":"2026-08-10T16:36:48.129075Z"}

