Ricoh Germany offers a wide range of products and services, including multifunction printers, copiers, fax machines, and scanners for efficient document management. They also provide imaging products, software solutions for document management and workflow automation, and consulting services to optimize office workflows. The company emphasizes sustainability through eco-friendly technologies and initiatives like the Comet Circle™, promoting responsible resource use.

Targeting various customer segments, Ricoh Germany serves small to large enterprises, public sector organizations, and creative professionals. Their solutions aim to enhance productivity, reduce environmental impact, and support innovation in workplaces across Germany.","updated_at":"2026-08-13T07:26:38.972564Z"}

{"id":"019254d0-e92c-74d0-9cc3-7cb47c7618bb","name":"Smiths Detection","domain":"smithsdetection.com","website":"https://smithsdetection.com","type":"public","legalName":null,"industry":"Manufacturing","industries":["Manufacturing/Telecommunication Equipment","Manufacturing/Industrial Machinery & Equipment","Manufacturing/Medical Devices & Equipment","Manufacturing/Photographic & Optical Equipment","Manufacturing/Test & Measurement Equipment"],"categories":["b2b","b2g"],"employees":"1K-5K","reported_employees":"1K-5K","revenue":"over-1b","description":"Smiths Detection is a global security technology company specializing in explosives and contraband detection, baggage and cargo screening, and urban security solutions. With origins in London, United Kingdom and a broad product portfolio spanning X-ray systems, chemical/biological detection, and integrated checkpoint solutions, the company serves aviation, ports and borders, defence, and urban security markets worldwide. Its technologies focus on material discrimination, threat identification, and automated analysis to protect public spaces and critical infrastructure. The company emphasizes end-to-end security solutions across market sectors including aviation, mail and parcel screening, and cargo protection.","keywords":["baggage screening","cargo screening","checkpoints","explosives detection systems","portable detection","trace detection","material discrimination","x-ray screening","urban security","air cargo screening","defence security","threat identification","biothreat detector","narcotics detection","security checkpoint integration","safety and security","military security","security equipment distribution","networked screening","engineering","control systems","sensors","mechanical seals","medical","energy","aerospace","manufacturing"],"technologies":["Akamai DNS","CSC Corporate Domains","Microsoft Azure Hosting","Microsoft Office 365","Outlook","Salesforce","Amazon-Cloudfront","Apache","Cloudflare-Cdn","Face