The company offers a wide range of products and services tailored to various sectors, including aviation, ports and borders, urban security, and defense. Its portfolio features cargo and baggage screening systems, high-energy cargo inspection technologies, and advanced chemical detectors. Smiths Detection has a strong global presence, with manufacturing and R&D facilities in multiple countries and a commitment to innovation, investing over £500 million in research and development over the past decade. 

