Ricoh Germany offers a wide range of products and services, including multifunction printers, copiers, fax machines, and scanners for efficient document management. They also provide imaging products, software solutions for document management and workflow automation, and consulting services to optimize office workflows. The company emphasizes sustainability through eco-friendly technologies and initiatives like the Comet Circle™, promoting responsible resource use.

Targeting various customer segments, Ricoh Germany serves small to large enterprises, public sector organizations, and creative professionals. Their solutions aim to enhance productivity, reduce environmental impact, and support innovation in workplaces across Germany.","updated_at":"2026-08-13T07:26:38.972564Z"}

{"id":"0192531d-c829-7b41-9433-b096da3722c4","name":"ACO","domain":"aco.com","website":"https://aco.com","type":"private","legalName":null,"industry":"Manufacturing","industries":["Manufacturing/Plastic, Packaging & Containers","Manufacturing/Tires & Rubber","Construction/Civil Engineering Construction","Retail"],"categories":["b2b"],"employees":"201-500","reported_employees":"5K-10K","revenue":"over-1b","description":"ACO is a global WaterTech company specializing in rainwater and wastewater management. The group offers systems and solutions under the ACO WaterCycle for professional drainage, cleaning, and controlled discharge or reuse of water, with a focus on sustainable water infrastructure and urban water management. Headquartered in Germany, ACO operates in over 50 countries and emphasizes innovation, sustainability, and transparent processes to improve water quality and cycle continuity. The company highlights applications in drainage, landscaping, hospitality, data centers, and other sectors through its worldwide references and regional subsidiaries.","keywords":["rainwater management","wastewater management","stormwater drainage","drainage systems","water cycle","sustainable water infrastructure","blue-green infrastructure","green city","urban water management","water reuse","water treatment","premier watertech","industrial drainage","gastronomy drainage","airport drainage","landscape drainage","gutter and trench drainage","oil and sediment separators","regional subsidiaries","water management","sustainable development","water recycling","pollution prevention","smart technology","groundwater preservation"],"technologies":["Outlook","Microsoft Office 365","Zendesk","Microsoft Azure Hosting","Google Maps","Google Font API","Hotjar","Salesforce","Cedexis Radar","Apple-Business-Manager","Caddy","Go","Google-Analytics","Google-Tag-Manager","Php","Section-Io","Typo3-Cms"],"subsidiaries":["acobd.co.uk","aco.bg","acocan.ca","aco.ch","aco.lv","aco.nl","aco.dk","aco-