ACO offers a range of professional drainage solutions, including drainage channels, oil and grease separators, backflow stop systems, pumps, and pressure-water-tight cellar windows. Their products focus on effective water management, environmental protection, and addressing climate change challenges by facilitating efficient drainage and water reuse.

With a history that dates back to the Carlshütte foundry established in 1827, ACO has expanded internationally through innovation and strategic acquisitions. The company serves various sectors, including construction, infrastructure, and environmental services, providing sustainable solutions to meet diverse customer needs.","updated_at":"2026-08-11T14:11:56.766932Z"}

{"id":"01925033-2d9b-78de-85f4-0c69b8820a36","name":"Eissmann Group Automotive","domain":"eissmann.com","website":"https://eissmann.com","type":"private","legalName":null,"industry":"Manufacturing","industries":["Manufacturing/Motor Vehicles","Manufacturing/Automotive Parts"],"categories":["b2b"],"employees":"201-500","reported_employees":"1K-5K","revenue":"10m-50m","description":"Eissmann Group Automotive designs and manufactures innovative interior solutions for the automotive industry, evolving from a component supplier to a system integrator. The company focuses on creating immersive vehicle interiors by integrating electronic components, control modules, and advanced haptic and lighting technologies. With a global presence and a multidisciplinary approach, it collaborates across engineering disciplines to transform complex interior challenges into compelling, user-focused experiences.","keywords":["automotive interior","system integration in automotive","interior electronics","haptics","kinematics","lighting design","control modules","vehicle interior","leather interior","interior ambience","mechatronik","electronics integration","dashboard interfaces","soft touch surfaces","sensor integration","human-machine interface","ergonomics in automotive","vehicle cabin design","fabric and trim design","plastics and materials","automotive","interior components","shifter modules","trim components","innovation","manufacturing"],"technologies":["Outlook","Microsoft Office 365","Google translate widget","Mobile Friendly","Apache","Google translate API","Apple-Business-Manager","Google-Pagespeed","Php","Typo3-Cms"],"subsidiaries":null,"founded_year":1964,"naics_codes":["336360","336399"],"location":{"country":{"code":"DE","name":"Germany","latitude":51,"longitude":9},"state":{"id":1376,"name":"Baden-Württemberg","code":"BW","latitude":48.661602,"longitude":9.350134},"city":{"id":34495,"name":"Bad Urach","latitude":48.49107,"longitude":9.40009},"address":"Münsinger Straße 150