The product range includes a variety of garage door openers equipped with smart home connectivity, obstacle detection, and enhanced security features. For commercial applications, LiftMaster offers UL 325 compliant door operators designed for safety and reliability. Their access control systems combine hardware with myQ Facility software, enabling facility-wide management and real-time alerts. Additionally, LiftMaster provides various accessories to enhance the functionality and safety of their garage door systems.

