{"id":"019259bf-6a1a-73a8-9551-5ca803118ee0","name":"SNP","domain":"snpgroup.com","website":"https://snpgroup.com","type":"public","legalName":null,"industry":"Business Services","industries":["Business Services/Custom Software & IT Services","Media & Internet/Data Collection & Internet Portals","Business Services","Business Services/Management Consulting","Business Services/Research & Development"],"categories":["b2b","saas","service-provider"],"employees":"501-1K","reported_employees":"1K-5K","revenue":"200m-1b","description":"SNP is a data transformation and enterprise data management company that helps organizations migrate, integrate, modernize, and govern large SAP and non-SAP data landscapes. Through its Kyano platform family, SNP provides unified data management, migration, and continuous system assessments to enable rapid, low-risk digital transformations across SAP ecosystems and other ERP environments. The company serves multiple industries worldwide, with a focus on SAP migrations, data lifecycle management, and ESG-aligned data strategies, headquartered in Europe. SNP emphasizes agility and big-data-driven transformation for global enterprises, including notable SAP-driven transformation projects.","keywords":["sap s/4hana migration","erp migration","data management","data modernization","data verification","sap active archiving","kyano platform","data landscape","mergers and acquisitions data","platform kyano-move","kyano crystalbridge","data migration automation","enterprise data transformation","data governance","data integration","cloud data migration","sap migration","data validation","data lifecycle management","digital transformation","IT management","data migration","cloud solutions","ERP consulting","software"],"technologies":["Atlassian Cloud","Atlassian Confluence","CloudFlare Hosting","GitLab","Jira","Salesforce","Amazon-Cloudfront","Apple-Business-Manager","Cloudflare-Cdn","Google-Tag-Manager","Hubspot"],"subsidiaries":null,"founded_year":1