The company focuses on complex SAP projects, offering services such as SAP S/4HANA migrations, mergers and acquisitions support, cloud data integration, and system landscape optimization. SNP's flagship platform, Kyano, enhances data migration and management processes, enabling faster and more secure transformations of SAP-centric IT landscapes. The recent acquisition of Datavard has further strengthened SNP's capabilities in cloud data integration and data management, allowing for comprehensive solutions in complex transformation projects.

