The sailing yachts feature over 40 models designed in collaboration with renowned naval architects, emphasizing modern interiors and customization options. The motor yachts are recognized for their high performance and elegant designs. HanseYachts is committed to sustainability, integrating eco-friendly materials and technologies throughout its operations. With a strong international presence and a dedicated US branch, the company serves a wide customer base, from amateur sailors to experienced yachtsmen.

HanseYachts AG is publicly traded and was the first German yacht builder listed on the Frankfurt Stock Exchange in 2007. The company continues to be a significant employer in its region, utilizing advanced production techniques to maintain its competitive edge.","updated_at":"2026-08-10T06:21:09.276986Z"}

{"id":"019259f4-45e5-7326-8d57-3379f774dc18","name":"BDSU","domain":"bdsu.de","website":"https://bdsu.de","type":"nonprofit","legalName":null,"industry":"Organizations","industries":["Education/Training","Business Services","Business Services/Management Consulting","Business Services/Research & Development","Organizations","Organizations/Membership Organizations","Organizations/Non-Profit & Charitable Organizations","Organizations/Religious Organizations"],"categories":["b2b","b2c","service-provider"],"employees":"11-50","reported_employees":"1K-5K","revenue":null,"description":"BDSU is the national federation of student-led management consulting initiatives in Germany. It unites 34 member organizations to promote student consulting, provide training, and foster collaboration between students and companies. The association focuses on professional development for students, entrepreneurship, and quality management through its TrainerAkademie and alumni networks. Based in Bonn, Germany, BDSU serves both university students and businesses seeking high-caliber student consulting projects.","keywords":["student consulting","junior entrepreneurship","university consulting networks","peer-to-peer consulting","management consulting education","student consulting associations","leadership training","quality management","trainerakademie","alumni network","business-student collaborations","Germany consulting students","professional development for students","industry partnerships","student firms","education","consulting services","student engagement","leadership development"],"technologies":["Outlook","MailChimp SPF","WordPress.org","Typekit","Mobile Friendly","Apache","CloudFlare Hosting","Microsot-365","Mysql","Php","Wordpress","Yoast-Seo"],"subsidiaries":null,"founded_year":1992,"naics_codes":["611430","541611","541618","813990"],"location":{"country":{"code":"DE","name":"Germany","latitude":51,"longitude":9},"state":{"id":1385,"name":"North Rhine-Westphalia","code":"NW","la