The association provides its members with access to valuable partnerships and resources, including a long-standing collaboration with think-cell, a Berlin-based software company. Since 2005, BDSU members have enjoyed free access to think-cell's data visualization tools, which are widely used by management consultancies and major German companies. This partnership helps professionals and students enhance their presentation skills and improve data communication.

BDSU e.V. focuses on advocacy, networking, and offering industry-relevant tools that strengthen its members' capabilities. It supports both established companies and emerging professionals in the security and defence sectors, contributing to growth and innovation in the industry.","updated_at":"2026-08-09T11:43:20.603017Z"}

