{"id":"019259c5-fb07-7faa-ab72-78e64597676d","name":"Münchenstift","domain":"muenchenstift.de","website":"https://muenchenstift.de","type":"nonprofit","legalName":null,"industry":"Healthcare Services","industries":["Healthcare Services/Elderly Care Services"],"categories":["b2c","mobile"],"employees":"51-200","reported_employees":"1K-5K","revenue":"1m-10m","description":"Münchenstift is a Munich-based elderly care provider operating 14 care and nursing homes along with comprehensive domiciliary and day care services. The organization offers competent and reliable care and assistance across Munich, focusing on residential care, domiciliary support, and day services. Approximately 3,000 elderly people live in its residences, with an emphasis on person-centered care, continuity, and ongoing development of services.","keywords":["elderly care","nursing homes","residential care","domiciliary care","day care","geriatric care","long-term care","assisted living","care homes","munich","senior living","residence network","care continuity","respite care","diversity-sensitive care","palliative care","multiple care concepts","outpatient care","resident surveys","senior care","ambulatory services","supported living","healthcare","non-profit"],"technologies":["Outlook","Microsoft Office 365","Nginx","Mobile Friendly","Vimeo","Apple-Business-Manager","Facebook-Social-Plugins","Google-Tag-Manager","Matomo","Microsoft-Asp-Net","Microsoft-Iis","Microsot-365"],"subsidiaries":null,"founded_year":1995,"naics_codes":["623110","623311","623312","621610","624120"],"location":{"country":{"code":"DE","name":"Germany","latitude":51,"longitude":9},"state":null,"city":null,"address":"3 Kirchseeoner Strasse","postal_code":"81669","phone":"+49 89 62020340"},"financial":{"stock_symbol":null,"stock_exchange":null,"total_funding":null,"funding_stage":null,"funding_date":null,"funding":null},"socials":{"linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/muenchenstift","linkedin_id":"6683543","twitter_url":"https://twitter.com/muenchenstift","facebook_url":"https://facebook.com/muenchenstift","instagram_url":"https://instagram.com/muenchenstift","angellist_url":null,"crunchbase_url":null,"youtube_url":null,"github_url":null,"g2_url":null},"page_rank":1.8608279,"logo_url":"https://api.companyenrich.com/companies/logo/019259c5-fb07-7faa-ab72-78e64597676d","seo_description":"MÜNCHENSTIFT is Munich's largest non-profit provider of care and support services for seniors, operating as a subsidiary of the City of Munich. The organization manages a network that includes nine nursing and retirement homes, five assisted living facilities, five ambulatory care service bases, and three day care centers, serving around 3,000 elderly residents. With a dedicated team of approximately 2,256 staff members, MÜNCHENSTIFT focuses on promoting a dignified and fulfilling life for older individuals.

The company offers a variety of tailored services, including inpatient care, assisted living, home care, and day care. Their approach emphasizes diversity-sensitive care, addressing the unique needs of each senior, including those of LGBTIQ* individuals. MÜNCHENSTIFT also supports family caregivers by providing day care services that allow seniors to receive care in a familiar environment.

Additionally, MÜNCHENSTIFT is committed to environmental responsibility, maintaining an environmental management system in line with the European Eco-Management and Audit Scheme (EMAS). This commitment reflects their dedication to sustainability while serving the senior community in Munich.","updated_at":"2026-08-04T18:26:31.635551Z"}

{"id":"0192585b-6794-7ec6-95ca-8c4a5b04b71e","name":"Centrotec","domain":"centrotec.de","website":"https://centrotec.de","type":"public","legalName":null,"industry":"Finance","industries":["Holding Companies & Conglomerates","Real Estate","Finance/Investment Banking","Finance/Lending & Brokerage","Finance/Venture Capital & Private Equity"],"categories":["b2b","service-provider"],"employees":"11-50","reported_employees":"1K-5K","revenue":"200m-1b","description":"Centrotec SE is a European investment holding focused on managing and growing a diversified portfolio across industrial companies, real estate developments, and financial assets. The group emphasizes long-term value creation, sustainability, and disciplined governance, with a footprint across Germany, the Netherlands, and other EU countries. It positions itself as an owner with a family heritage and multi-generational time horizon, aiming to build great companies and deliver superior returns for investors. The company operates as a parent to industrial, real estate, and financial activities, seeking opportunities to contribute to sustainable and liveable urban environments.","keywords":["industrial portfolio","real estate developments","financial asset management","urban real estate","sustainable cities","long-term investment","family investment company","german roots","global reach","portfolio rebalancing","value-oriented investing","ownership mindset","leadership culture","eu investment firm","european markets","industrial real estate","active asset management","public and private sectors","real assets","energy efficiency","heating systems","ventilation technology","climate control","renewable energy","solar thermal","biogas","heat recovery"],"technologies":["Mimecast","Microsoft Azure Hosting","Microsoft Office 365","Sophos","Microsoft Azure","Apache","Ubuntu","Mobile Friendly","Vue-Js"],"subsidiaries":null,"founded_year":1998,"naics_codes":["551112","551114","531390","531312","523920"],"location":{"countr