The company operates through three main segments. The Climate Systems segment develops and sells a range of heating and ventilation solutions aimed at improving energy efficiency and indoor air quality. The Gas Flue Systems segment provides condensing boilers and air piping systems that enhance home ventilation and promote energy savings. Additionally, CENTROTEC SE has a Medical Technology & Engineering Plastics segment, which manufactures medical technology products and diagnostic instruments, showcasing its diversification into healthcare.

CENTROTEC SE serves a diverse clientele, including residential, commercial, and industrial customers, by offering innovative and sustainable technologies that enhance energy efficiency and environmental performance in building systems, along with a presence in the medical technology sector.","updated_at":"2026-08-11T09:55:07.393794Z"}

