{"id":"01924e6c-a2a1-7fda-9763-9cb81dff1250","name":"BAUKING","domain":"bauking.de","website":"https://bauking.de","type":"public","legalName":"BAUKING GmbH","industry":"Retail","industries":["Retail","Retail/Home Improvement & Hardware Retail"],"categories":["b2b","e-commerce"],"employees":"51-200","reported_employees":"1K-5K","revenue":"50m-100m","description":"BAUKING is a German building materials retailer and online wholesaler serving construction professionals, tradespeople, and industry customers. Its product range includes building materials, construction elements, tools, timber, tiles, doors, roofing and facade products, insulation, drywall supplies, machinery, and professional accessories. The company provides online ordering, warehouse pickup, and delivery to construction sites through its network of locations in Germany.","keywords":["building materials","building materials wholesaler","construction supplies","construction materials","construction elements","trade supplies","professional construction equipment","building tools","civil engineering","road construction","landscaping supplies","drainage systems","cable protection","water management","structural construction","steel construction","chemical building materials","insulation materials","drywall construction","interior finishing","roofing materials","facade materials","roof drainage","roof windows","timber","construction timber","flooring","wall coverings","ceiling materials","doors","gates","windows","door hardware","tiles","bathroom renovation","natural stone","artificial stone","workplace safety","construction equipment","construction machinery","fastening technology","private-label building products","construction site delivery","warehouse pickup","B2B ecommerce","Germany","timber trade","construction services","DIY","home improvement","hardware","equipment rental"],"technologies":["MailJet","Outlook","Microsoft Office 365","Hubspot","AngularJS","Nginx","reCAPTCHA","Mobile Friendly","WordPress