The company offers a wide range of construction materials, including roofing and facade products, windows, doors, gates, and tiles. BAUKING also provides various services such as financing options, construction planning, insurance services, contractor mediation, and order picking. Additionally, it offers rental services for equipment, scaffolding, and containers to support customers throughout their building projects.

BAUKING GmbH is part of the hagebau cooperative, enhancing its market position and resource network. With nearly 4,000 employees and a group turnover of approximately 1.45 billion euros, BAUKING is a key player in the German building materials market, committed to serving both professional builders and DIY customers effectively.","updated_at":"2026-08-10T22:46:48.853673Z"}

{"id":"019259de-3a37-7a2d-991e-a8affd03e5cf","name":"Knaus Tabbert","domain":"knaustabbert.de","website":"https://knaustabbert.de","type":"public","legalName":"Knaus Tabbert AG","industry":"Manufacturing","industries":["Manufacturing/Motor Vehicles","Manufacturing/Automotive Parts"],"categories":["b2b","b2c"],"employees":"51-200","reported_employees":"1K-5K","revenue":"over-1b","description":"Knaus Tabbert is a leading European manufacturer of recreational vehicles. The company produces motorhomes, caravans, camper vans and related leisure vehicles under six brands: KNAUS, TABBERT, WEINSBERG, T@B, MORELO and RENT AND TRAVEL. It operates production sites in Germany and Hungary and serves customers, dealers and rental partners across Europe.","keywords":["recreational vehicles","motorhomes","caravans","camper vans","campervans","leisure vehicles","caravan manufacturing","motorhome manufacturing","caravaning","camping vehicles","travel trailers","luxury motorhomes","vehicle production","vehicle design","vehicle innovation","dealer network","motorhome rental","caravan rental","KNAUS","TABBERT","WEINSBERG","T@B","MORELO","RENT AND TRAVEL","manufacturing","camping","leisure travel"],"technologies":["Outlook","Microsoft Office 365","Sophos","Facebook Login (Connect)","Google Analytics","Google Tag Manager","Mobile Friendly","Apache","Google-Maps","Google-Tag-Manager","Php","Typo3-Cms"],"subsidiaries":null,"founded_year":2009,"naics_codes":["336211","336212"],"location":{"country":{"code":"DE","name":"Germany","latitude":51,"longitude":9},"state":{"id":1377,"name":"Bavaria","code":"BY","latitude":48.790447,"longitude":11.4978895},"city":{"id":36058,"name":"Jandelsbrunn","latitude":48.73333,"longitude":13.7},"address":"Helmut‐Knaus‐Str. 19","postal_code":"94118","phone":"+49 (0)8583 / 21–1"},"financial":{"stock_symbol":"KTA.DE","stock_exchange":"etra","total_funding":440100000,"funding_stage":null,"funding_date":null,"funding":[{"date":"2021-12-01T00:00:00Z","amount":"169630