The company offers a diverse range of leisure vehicles through its various brands. KNAUS is recognized for its innovative motorhomes and caravans, including popular models like the SÜDWIND and SUN TI. TABBERT is celebrated for its high-quality caravans, featuring unique design elements and a tradition of craftsmanship. Other brands under Knaus Tabbert include WEINSBERG, T@B, and MORELO, catering to a wide array of customer preferences.

